{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_04",
  "title": "不念往昔",
  "storyCode": "WB-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bb626ed277b6c3bf69edc5afb3b3ca388df6fcf196b07ceebbe4fc81a47a5a17",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "孟叔，孟叔，你在裡面嗎？我有話要問你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "我是杜遙夜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "text": "姑娘，別敲了，沒看見門口掛的牌子啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "text": "晚飯時候門就關了，你有啥事明天再來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "text": "嘿，怎麼還不理人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "孟叔！你是不是有事瞞著我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "再不答應，我就自己進去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "text": "又來一個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "text": "現在的年輕人怎麼都大半夜往鐵匠鋪跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "嗯？行裕客棧鄭掌櫃的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "你是之前找過爹的那個年輕官差？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "杜小姐何時來的玉門？此刻出現在這裡又所為何事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "找人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "你又是來幹嘛的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "查案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "官府查到鑄劍坊，難道孟叔他真的做了什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "聽杜小姐的語氣，這裡果真有問題......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "是我在問你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "倘若杜小姐和此事無關，還請不要耽誤在下查案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "誰在耽誤誰......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刀光硬生生截斷了杜遙夜的話頭。\n門鎖落下，“暫停營業”的牌子碎成兩半，左樂已經衝進了鑄劍坊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "text": "（孟大哥只是讓我盯著些，想不到真有人來鬧事。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "text": "（不行，得去叫人來幫忙。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "你幹什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "跟你說話呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "打你怎麼了！官差就是這麼查案的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "進。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "鯉先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "剛看到槐琥跑了出去，風風火火的，我喊她都沒答應。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "畢竟才剛大學畢業，正是一腔熱血的年紀，難免頭腦簡單，雨霞姑娘多教教她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "鯉先生的員工，哪輪得到我來指手畫腳。是我給她添麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哪裡的話。年輕人嘛，多長長見識，也是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "憑那孩子的身手，就算遇到幾個壞人，也用不著擔心就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "昨天晚上，爸他找過鯉先生，是有事情找您幫忙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "也談不上幫忙......只是在找人的時候順便聽到了一些故事，偵探的耳朵總是靈一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "要是能對雨霞姑娘查案有幫助，那就再好不過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "鯉先生請坐，講故事總不能站著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "讓我想想該從何說起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "打個比方，如果魏彥吾和令尊不合，那龍門會變成什麼樣子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“天災當前，城裡又有山海眾作亂，將軍親自帶兵鎮守城門，哪有工夫見一個百姓？”\n“我聽說這個人以前和將軍認識。”\n“還是通報一下吧，萬一他真有什麼事呢？”\n......\n“你上去吧，將軍同意見你。”\n“他就在城樓上。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夜已經很深了。\n軍用源石射燈嵌進城牆，隨臺階一路上鋪，周圍明亮得像是白晝。\n但孟鐵衣走得很慢，身後的軍士也沒有催他。\n他已經十多年沒有登上玉門的城樓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "見過平祟侯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "......你就直接說明來意吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "希望平祟侯能批准我出城。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "信使隊伍出了事，聽說屍骨都沒剩下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "隊伍裡有鑄劍坊的幾位兄弟，總得有人去接他們。起碼也該在他們身死的地方，灑一壇酒，捧幾抔沙回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "來人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "text": "將軍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "封城的命令，是否已經下達到了全城？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "text": "......是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "你聽到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "所以我才來找平祟侯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "絕無可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "text": "這位師傅，玉門正在高速移動，一日幾十里，外面是茫茫戈壁，現在就算放你出城也沒有用......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "多嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "是啊，玉門已經走得太遠了，沙漠風大，兄弟們要怎麼找回來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "逝者已矣，但玉門前行，不容耽擱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "殺害信使團隊的賊寇已潛入城中，現在全城戒嚴，早日將他們一網打盡，也能告慰亡者的在天之靈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "既然如此，還請平祟侯恩准我們一起追查兇手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "這陣子城裡人員混雜，我們這些跑江湖的，總能幫得上忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "捉拿兇手，護衛玉門，玉門軍人職責所在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "如果還要勞煩百姓，是左某無能了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "你來找我，就為了此事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "text": "於空中出劍，力道凌厲無匹，竟然能強行收住勁頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "text": "羽獸凌江，銜鱗而起，水面只留下漣漪點點。師姐發勁收勁，又到了新的境界。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "text": "師姐可否再演示一遍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "除非你能讓剛剛那隻受驚的小沙地獸再躥出來一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "text": "......倒是不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "所謂招式，不過是把人的反應抽象歸整，方便理解。人的反應哪裡有定數，武功的精妙都在臨場的變化裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "你記錄天下武學，別老跟一招一式過不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "text": "“形”是軀殼，“意”是精神，老師很早就教導過我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "人哪，有些事情明明知道，但總是改不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "你也是太呆了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錄武官",
      "text": "好像是千夫長在集結軍隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "足足一個百人隊，好大的陣仗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "text": "千夫長，隊伍已經集結完畢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "text": "清點裝備，跟我前往城南鑄劍坊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "text": "原來是仇姑娘和錄武官小哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "千夫長現在整兵，難道是發現了山海眾的行蹤？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "text": "太合御史在鑄劍坊附近被人重傷，左樂公子命我帶兵清查鑄劍坊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "行動通報了平祟侯沒有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "text": "將軍現在鎮守外城樓，昨天已經授權給公子，三日內可以調度他的親兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "有直接證據證明是鑄劍坊幹的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "text": "具體的還不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "左樂人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "text": "公子已經先一步過去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "text": "太合御史受傷，他很著急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "關門閉戶，歹人聚集，好個鑄劍坊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰險的山海眾成員",
      "text": "人不在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰險的山海眾成員",
      "text": "居然和秉燭人暗中往來，姓孟的果然不可信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "天災數據還在姓孟的身上，去把他找出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "先解決對面這兩個娃娃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "你們到底是什麼人？孟叔呢？他是遭了你們的毒手，還是和你們一夥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "大小齊又在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "不說話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "那就打到你們說話為止......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刀光從杜遙夜身旁掠過，左樂踏步向前。\n他一言不發，刀揮得很快，眉頭皺得很緊。\n這是杜遙夜今天第二次被截斷話語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "混帳——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰險的山海眾成員",
      "text": "什麼人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這裡不能被毀掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "text": "你們住手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "text": "院子裡的東西都被打壞了，要打出去打！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰險的山海眾成員",
      "text": "居然還藏著幫手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "text": "（嘶——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "這把劍怎麼會在她身上......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰險的山海眾成員",
      "text": "頭兒，這女娃身上有傷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "先解決她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是突然起了一陣風，滿院的細沙被攪起，人影交錯。\n受傷的異族少女捂著傷口後退，靠在老槐樹上用力喘息。她沒有注意到杜遙夜的靠近。\n蒙面的凶徒再次隱入屋簷邊的陰影。\n年輕的秉燭人走到庭院中間，將兩個少女擋在身後。他的腰間不知何時多出來一把劍，被暗扣牢牢鎖住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "text": "我的劍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "肩上什麼時候空的？剛剛的衝擊......\n一截斷裂的皮料落在地上。那是族人用獵到的動物毛皮製成的束帶，堅韌耐磨，用來綁劍再合適不過。\n綁那柄她一刻也不曾離身的劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "這是宗師的佩劍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "既然你與山海眾並無勾結，劍現在在我手裡，權且算你物歸原主。擅闖軍營的罪責，之後再追究。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "text": "......你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "text": "還給我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "text": "你是誰？你不要拉我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "你的傷不輕，我警告你不要亂動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "我不管那把劍什麼情況。但你既然早就藏在鑄劍坊裡，說明你認識孟鐵衣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "還請告訴我，他現在去了哪裡？你有沒有在鑄劍坊裡看見兩個尚蜀年輕人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "text": "要是不說，我會在你的傷口上再補一拳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰險的山海眾成員",
      "text": "看來這幾個傢伙並不是一起的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰險的山海眾成員",
      "text": "外面的人，封好出口，別讓他們有路跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰險的山海眾成員",
      "text": "聽到沒有？回話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聲音近在咫尺。他慌忙回頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "疼痛隨著自己的移動而越發清晰，清晰得就像那個斷成兩截的通訊工具。\n他沒來得及後悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "仇姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "外面的已經解決了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "和先前在集市襲擊你的是同一批人。山海眾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "魯莽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "你不止是武藝沒有長進......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "等拿了這夥人，我再聽仇姐姐教訓！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "......等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剛才還沒察覺，只是出了幾劍，手心竟然已經生汗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "這間院子......這個溫度......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "好像越來越熱了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "如今只到三月份，也還沒看見太陽，氣溫怎麼反而在升高？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "難道是鑄劍坊的源石鍛造爐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "爐火早就熄了 。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "氣憤的山海眾成員",
      "text": "頭兒，她傷了我們好幾個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "別再浪費時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你們還知道浪費了時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三月中，這個時節會有蟬鳴嗎？\n空氣中的濕意沉沉地壓下來，黏膩透衣，這絕不是早春的露。\n在場所有人都感受到了異樣。\n一滴水落在仇白的臉上。\n北地春來遲，老槐還來不及長出新葉——\n這是刀刃凝出的水珠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "text": "孟鐵衣呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "不在鑄劍坊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "text": "我們正準備離開，就遇上了這幾個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "這把刀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "就是你傷了太合叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
